# YOISAKI AI STUDIO — optional environment of the LOCAL server (Termux). Copy to .env only if you need it;
# .env is ignored by Git. Nothing here is required for a personal installation.
#
# Port of the local website (default 3000).
# PORT=3000
# Data folder (default ~/.local/share/yoisaki-ai-studio): state.json, secrets.json (0600), gallery.
# YOISAKI_DATA_DIR=
#
# Public Google OAuth client of a DISTRIBUTION (type "Desktop app"), provisioned by the maintainer — see
# PUBLIC_GITHUB_SETUP.md. Leave empty: then every user enters their own client once on the Models page.
# Alternative: config/google-oauth-client.json {"client_id": "...", "client_secret": "..."} (also ignored by Git).
# YOISAKI_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
# YOISAKI_GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
#
# The CloudCompute API key is NOT configured here: each user enters their own key in the app (GPU page).
